{"title":"2025 CEMC Cayley Problems/Problem 14","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_CEMC_Cayley_Problems/Problem_14&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Yesterday, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/f/3/8f37626d49b4082c9102bf930bca51277ff2eb43.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$200$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"29\" height=\"14\" /> people bought ice cream at the Cayley Creamery.\n</p><p>A total of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/f/e/7fea07b9bf739f8e420081f31186264b91ced2ce.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$85$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> people ordered fudge with their ice cream.\n</p><p>A total of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/0/2/302e99c1c7cd91a6ae371139e5142ccef5977dca.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$60$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> people ordered sprinkles with their ice cream.\n</p><p>A total of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/f/4/4f4b8590f8aa9f9894b3891dd5dede0e354fa04e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$32$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> people ordered both fudge and sprinkles.\n</p><p>How many of the <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/f/3/8f37626d49b4082c9102bf930bca51277ff2eb43.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$200$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"29\" height=\"14\" /> people ordered neither fudge nor sprinkles?\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/1/6/c1627ae7b9f4fb0f0af2af99bfd154d61135a300.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A)}\\ 23  \\qquad \t\\textbf{(B)}\\ 55  \\qquad \t\\textbf{(C)}\\ 87  \\qquad \t\\textbf{(D)}\\ 113  \\qquad \t\\textbf{(E)}\\ 168  \\qquad$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"448\" height=\"18\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_CEMC_Cayley_Problems/Problem_14&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Since <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/f/4/4f4b8590f8aa9f9894b3891dd5dede0e354fa04e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$32$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> people ordered both and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/0/2/302e99c1c7cd91a6ae371139e5142ccef5977dca.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$60$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> ordered sprinkles, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/5/4/c54de199b053b970e04b9477bcc25b7cad8d1fb2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$60 - 32 = 28$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"103\" height=\"15\" /> of them ordered sprinkles but not fudge.\n</p><p>This means that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/c/3/1c3c797cdd259fa7d90c324a207aed9d6233eebb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$85 + 28 = 113$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"112\" height=\"15\" /> people either ordered fudge or sprinkles. This can also be visualised with a venn diagram.\n</p><p>Thus, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/1/5/015aa9e6d16940dd9cf8493de0bfdf1461d68c3a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$200 - 113$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"79\" height=\"15\" /> people ordered neither fudge nor sprinkles, or <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/d/f/8dffd2d87bdfa3e09b54bc3a94e1c111f5a219f5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf {(C) } 87}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"66\" height=\"30\" />\n</p><p>~anabel.disher\n</p>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbo